on exitFrame
  [  0] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [  3] pusharglist 1 ........................... <2>
  [  5] extcall 50 .............................. <soundBusy(2)>
  [  8] not ..................................... <not soundBusy(2)>
  [  9] jmpifz [ 32] ............................ if not soundBusy(2) then
  [ 12] pushsymb 42 ............................. <#playFile>
  [ 15] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [ 18] getglobal 21 ............................ <effectspath>
  [ 20] getglobal 97 ............................ <whichsnd>
  [ 23] joinstr ................................. <effectspath & whichsnd>
  [ 24] pushcons 0 .............................. <".aif">
  [ 26] joinstr ................................. <effectspath & whichsnd & ".aif">
  [ 27] pusharglistnoret 3 ...................... <2, effectspath & whichsnd & ".aif">
  [ 29] extcall 43 .............................. sound playFile 2, effectspath & whichsnd & ".aif"
  [ 32] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [ 34] extcall 53 .............................. whatodoeveryframe2()
  [ 37] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 38] pusharglist 1 ........................... <0>
  [ 40] extcall 2 ............................... <marker(0)>
  [ 42] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <marker(0)>
  [ 44] extcall 3 ............................... go(marker(0))
  [ 46] ret
end
